                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Don't buy this game.  It is impossible to clear level 1-19 as they don't give you enough resources.  Most levels can't even be done in any time, much less in 3 stars and the movement is so slow and ridiculous.  I thought I could live with the clunkiness and the having to have the worker back in the  start area to go back out again, but when you can't even finish a level, because the devs didn't put enough resources on the level, that's just bad design and testing.\nThere are no bonuses you can use (at least they haven't appeared up to level 19) to help you in any way.\nAlso, there is a trophy page, but it is full of scientific notation and you can't even see what the trophies are for.  So sorry I wasted 4 hours of my life on this junky game.",
